# back/quiver: the archer's quiver with its arrows (`sheath quiver`, every bow fighter: P2C_CONTRACTS 3), P2c SLICE-ARMS
# 2026-10-23. STYLE_P2 25.7 (the bow on the back with the quiver, arrows showing: the delight) and 25.9 (it stays on the
# back in the run). A boiled-leather tube slung over the right shoulder, the strap's brass stud, its lit rim, and the
# fletchings standing out of the mouth (linen, one cock feather in the accent). On the neck anchor like a scabbard on the
# sheath channel: rest, kick (the run), lag (a pixel behind the bob), drawn (it stays while the bow is out), sit, stride;
# lie draws nothing (back items lie under the body). Behind the body facing down and in the side views (the fletchings
# over the shoulder), over the back facing up. Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
legend V linen 0
legend W linen 1
legend X linen 2
legend Y linen 3
legend Z linen 4
body adult
role sheath quiver
anchor neck
keys sheath
z 31

view D key rest origin 7 3 layer back
|Y.Y.
|nYnY
|.nYf
|..ff

